          "Target": "self",
          "Code": "-- 버튼이 클릭되었을 때 실행됩니다.\nlocal ui_1 = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(\"/ui/0_캐릭터생성-UI\")\nlocal ui_2 = _EntityService:GetEntityByPath(\"/ui/0_캐릭터선택-UI\")\nlocal myPlayer = _UserService.LocalPlayer\n\nui_1.Enable = true\nui_2.Enable = false\nself:MoveToDestination(myPlayer)",
